Z||000022||Lewis||05-17-2000||04:19 PM||||I have an 6cyl, auto and it shifts gears between 2000 and 2500 rpm depending on how fast you take off.  If you tromp on it the gears shift higher around 3000.  Hope this helps....||||reg||1
